-- =============================================================================
-- University of Nigeria, Nsukka — Faculty of Engineering
-- Department of Agricultural and Bioresources Engineering
-- Course outlines transcribed from the Faculty of Engineering course handbook
-- (scanned/photographed copy), Chapter Three, book pages 37-41 (programme
-- structure) and 45-46 onward (course descriptions).
-- =============================================================================
-- Run in the Supabase SQL Editor. Safe to run more than once: existing rows
-- for this department are removed first, so it updates rather than duplicates.
--
-- PROGRAMME: a 5-year B.Eng. The first two years cover engineering sciences
-- common to all engineering disciplines; discipline-specialisation courses
-- start in third year; in the final (fifth) year the student takes one of
-- FOUR options:
--   Option One   — Power Systems, Machinery and Mechatronics
--   Option Two   — Soil, Water Resources and Aquacultural Engineering
--   Option Three — Food and Bioprocess Engineering
--   Option Four  — Structures and Environmental Engineering
-- All four options are transcribed below. Because a course's level/semester
-- is the same across options, option-specific fifth-year courses are stored
-- once each, with the option named in the description where the handbook
-- itself scopes it that way.
--
-- SEMESTERS: the handbook explicitly labels every course "First Semester" or
-- "Second Semester" in its programme-structure tables, so those stated values
-- are used directly — no guessing was needed.
--
-- CREDIT UNITS — HOW THEY WERE VERIFIED: the photographed pages are shot at an
-- angle, so the units column does not always sit level with its own row. Every
-- semester's units were therefore reconciled against the handbook's own
-- printed "Total:" line for that semester before being accepted. Every
-- semester below balances exactly against its printed total, with the single
-- exception noted under GAPS.
--
-- A NOTE ON ONE INTERNAL INCONSISTENCY IN THE SOURCE:
--   FOURTH YEAR, FIRST SEMESTER prints "Total: 20", but its own nine listed
--   unit values are individually legible at high magnification and read
--   2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 3, 2 — which sum to 19, not 20. This is an
--   arithmetic error in the handbook itself, not an unreadable digit. The
--   nine per-course values are recorded below exactly as printed; the
--   handbook's own total is the thing that is wrong.
--
-- GAPS (following the same convention as unn_mechanical_engineering_outline.sql):
--   * FIFTH YEAR, OPTION TWO, SECOND SEMESTER: the photograph of this page is
--     cut off partway down the table. Only ABE 522 (Design of Soil Water
--     Conservation Structures) and ABE 524 (Rural Water Supply and Sanitation)
--     are legible, and a further row beginning "ABE 526" is cropped away
--     entirely, along with that semester's own "Total:" line — so there is no
--     checksum to recover the missing values from either. ABE 522 is therefore
--     recorded with credit_units = 0, this table's "not yet known" sentinel
--     (0 is the column default and no other row in the table uses it), rather
--     than guessed; ABE 526 is omitted entirely since even its title is
--     unknown. Re-photograph book page 42 to complete this one semester.
--     (ABE 524 still appears below via Option Four, where the same course is
--     printed legibly with its units.)
--   * COURSE DESCRIPTIONS: the handbook prints full descriptions for the ABE
--     courses. This file currently carries the verified descriptions
--     transcribed so far (ABE 201, 252, 254, 301, 302, 304, 312, 314, 321,
--     322). Every other course carries its real code/title/units/level/
--     semester from the programme-structure table with the description left
--     blank pending transcription of the remaining description pages
--     (book pages 47 onward) — never invented.
--   * ANCILLARY COURSES FROM OTHER DEPARTMENTS: CVE/EEE/MEC/MTH/CHM/PHY/GSP/
--     STA/CED/SSC/ANS/CSC/AGE/EGR courses appear in this department's
--     timetable but their descriptions are printed under their own owning
--     departments, not here. Per this app's cross-referencing convention they
--     carry real code/title/units only in this file; their descriptions are
--     served from the owning department's own outline where one exists
--     (e.g. EGR 101/102, MTH 111/121/122, CHM 101/112/122/171,
--     PHY 116/121/124/195, GSP 101/102 are already carried in full in
--     unn_mechanical_engineering_outline.sql).
-- =============================================================================

delete from public.course_outlines
 where institution = 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka'
   and department = 'Agricultural and Bioresources Engineering';

insert into public.course_outlines
